### Banking Transactions API — sample requests
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy into curl/Postman.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{base}}/

### 1. Create a deposit (201 Created)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-00000",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### 2. Create a transfer (201 Created)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### 3. Validation error (400) — negative amount, bad currency, bad account
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -5,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### 4. List all transactions
GET {{base}}/transactions

### 5. Filter by account
GET {{base}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### 6. Filter by type
GET {{base}}/transactions?type=transfer

### 7. Filter by date range + account (combined)
GET {{base}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### 8. Get a single transaction (replace the id)
GET {{base}}/transactions/txn_REPLACE_ME

### 9. Get account balance
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### 10. Get account summary (Task 4A)
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

### 11. Export transactions as CSV (Task 4C)
GET {{base}}/transactions/export?format=csv
